   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 412.46,
   "dur": 2.53,
   "speech": "返回值不是裸向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 415.54,
   "dur": 2.63,
   "speech": "是值，加一个掩码。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 418.72,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "因为下游必须知道，哪个数是观测，哪个数是猜测。"
  },
  {
